### Webhook Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### Generic Provider Webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json
Finwave-Signature: {{webhookSignature}}

{
  "type": "test_event",
  "data": {
    "id": "evt_1234567890",
    "object": "event",
    "created": 1641234567
  }
}

### Stripe Webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/stripe
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: {{stripeSignature}}

{
  "id": "evt_1234567890",
  "object": "event",
  "api_version": "2020-08-27",
  "created": 1641234567,
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "po_1234567890",
      "object": "payout",
      "amount": 1000,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "paid"
    }
  },
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1,
  "request": {
    "id": "req_1234567890",
    "idempotency_key": null
  },
  "type": "payout.paid"
}

### Example Stripe Payout Events:

### Payout Paid Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/stripe
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: {{stripeSignature}}

{
  "id": "evt_payout_paid",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payout.paid",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "po_1234567890",
      "object": "payout",
      "amount": 1000,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "paid",
      "arrival_date": 1641234567,
      "balance_transaction": "txn_1234567890"
    }
  }
}

### Payout Failed Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/stripe
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: {{stripeSignature}}

{
  "id": "evt_payout_failed",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payout.failed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "po_1234567890",
      "object": "payout",
      "amount": 1000,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "failed",
      "failure_code": "account_closed",
      "failure_message": "The bank account has been closed."
    }
  }
}

### Payout Canceled Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/stripe
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: {{stripeSignature}}

{
  "id": "evt_payout_canceled",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payout.canceled",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "po_1234567890",
      "object": "payout",
      "amount": 1000,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "canceled"
    }
  }
}

### Variables (set these in your environment or replace manually):
# @webhookSignature = v1=signature_hash_here
# @stripeSignature = t=1641234567,v1=stripe_signature_hash_here